      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嗯……严重到发烧的程度很少见喔。\n毕竟现在的小美身体并不算特别差。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d627d16412e434cdf8a691dd8562b35e9d4d1afacb2c166b2b26775a4b4a9648",
