      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "真是出乎意料。之前看到的美丽周日，\n一直都相当开朗有活力。但仔细回想起来──",
      "source_fingerprint": "25e93cb362cd517795c7f24333f00f95deae08baad672a334b08bb7265be8688",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
