    {
      "uid": "zhcn:288903827a4ce5f31cc1a78f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "初次相遇那天她也因用尽力气而倒在赛道上无法动弹。\n看来她真的不擅长替自己踩刹车。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb298c20a6948f9dda8ab6946dc3370c2b0e719bd4fe73e2217974552a0c15b0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
