    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e5a0f1ba82685336b02e384",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她一边开朗地笑着一边奔跑的样子让我感到相当耀眼，\n我也对她活力的根源──“美丽”充满兴趣。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2d35785f72fa20aa3429c2dee64d121f22e1f402e45e1850aa364354921f5d7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1055/storytimeline_041055002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        36,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/36/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:127d4bc0df2f50d38c819f96",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（让她做到这个地步的美丽，究竟是指……？）",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c008be8f838b3b8b9c130a9385690df5aa269f6164b11f8bd8f74f5be5c55de",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
