    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e6915d573ebd58a801c54c9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但对她而，“美丽”似乎有着让她过度勉强自己，\n甚至搞坏身体程度的重大意义。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee92feed2f083ee2eb7d0bfa3702656bb7489c46224ceadf2a9337f6f3dda975",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
